{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Troy</strong>, the new <strong>Gatekeeper</strong>. His job is simple: close the gates at a desolate railway crossing for one month. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is his last chance to earn back his wife's trust. To prove he can stay sober. To become a better man. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join him at the Tower in the middle of nowhere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help Troy fix his life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/4e9773db425cc9157a8ed9c4540f05f8.poster.avif?t=1752823622\" width=612 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/4e9773db425cc9157a8ed9c4540f05f8.webm?t=1752823622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/4e9773db425cc9157a8ed9c4540f05f8.mp4?t=1752823622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of <strong>The Cat Lady</strong>, <strong>Downfall</strong> (original and remake), <strong>Lorelai</strong> and <strong>Burnhouse Lane</strong> <strong>TRAINWATCH</strong> is the sixth game by solo developer <strong>Harvester Games</strong>. It blends elements of adventure game, time-management and life simulation with a touch of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity &amp; Stamina system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle with time-dependent events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective system &amp; light inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression - gain experience, level up and unlock skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogues and complex narrative with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by micAmic and guests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English voice acting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/22bd0ae1c1a857a815eea72033870246.poster.avif?t=1752823622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/22bd0ae1c1a857a815eea72033870246.webm?t=1752823622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/22bd0ae1c1a857a815eea72033870246.mp4?t=1752823622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864940?t=1752823622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/f67ce4496a99c215010f63f9c9b7284450392e32/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752823622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/74eefad1e4b9ab902e3931faa55235f4364a2610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752823622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/74eefad1e4b9ab902e3931faa55235f4364a2610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752823622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":6