ina system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle with time-dependent events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective system &amp; light inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression - gain experience, level up and unlock skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogues and complex narrative with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by micAmic and guests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English voice acting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/22bd0ae1c1a857a815eea72033870246.poster.avif?t=1752823622\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/22bd0ae1c1a857a815eea72033870246.webm?t=1752823622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/extras/22bd0ae1c1a857a815eea72033870246.mp4?t=1752823622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Harvester Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864940/be3abbf6d5af79e25783f86b39fd92d8ff4c734b/header.jpg?t=1752823622","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3864